            "description": "THIS IS THE INTERESTING ONE. The server will hold the request open until a driver accepts. You'll see Postman's spinner spin for a few seconds, then suddenly the response appears with full driver info (name, vehicle, rating, ETA). Increase Postman's request timeout to 60s+ in Settings if needed."
          }
